        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K650-HAR, Clear Crystal Hartford Knobset with Revere Backplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hartford Crystal Knob with Revere Plate has a beautiful and classic look that makes it great for traditional homes. The oval beaded backplate paired with the clear crystal knob makes for an elegant latchset. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Clear Crystal Hartford Knobset with Revere Backplate will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href= \"/products/revere-latchset-brass-accents-d05-k650\"><b>More Knob and Lever Options</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D05-K650-HAR Revere Latchset with Hartford Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
